    "en": {
      "text": "//ENHANCED: SINGLE SHOT VERSION\n\nFor single-shot weapons:\nScoring 3 hits with at least 1.2 seconds or at most 4 seconds between each other grants ? Reload Speed and <enhanced/><pve 6% /> <pvp [?] /> increased damage for 8 seconds.\n\nAdditional hits while the buff duration is below 4 seconds refresh the timer to 4 seconds.\n\n\nFor multi-shot weapons:\nScoring 3 hits with at least 0.8 seconds or at most 1.2 seconds between each other <title refills [G_refill] /> 10% of the magazine and grants <enhanced/><pve 6% /> <pvp [?] /> increased damage for 4 seconds.\n\n<enhanced/> Damage bonus is increased by 20% (5%<arrow/>6%).",
      "updatedAt": "2026-01-19T16:39:57.984Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
